+## Not For
+
+- **Quick one-off scripts or single-file changes** — just write the code
+- **Exploratory prototyping** — use `spike` skill instead
+- **Production-ready project planning with persistent state** — use `plan` skill (saves to `.hermes/plans/`)
+- **Code review or verification** — use `requesting-code-review` skill
+- **Direct execution** — this skill produces a plan document, not running code
+
 ## Bite-Sized Task Granularity
 
 **Each task = 2-5 minutes of focused work.**
